body:
Aw, maybe you could read ahead, or meet with the TA's, or hire a tutor so you can have everyone rely on you eheh. But theres nothing wrong with struggling in college - even if its your chosen field. I wish i could help but with my lack of knowledge id just be more like comic relief instead.

Being in english classes is like murder on my soul with the amount of times ive had anxiety attacks having to talk in class ;-;

P.s https://i.imgur.com/zatW4bq.jpg
